{"title":"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/c/89c6b743a00d6023fc15227a551f1b4d4c37829c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$857$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/3/aa38d2c7ab9f84fb19b1f92c06ed47170e409d59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$908$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by the same positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda00d9a38a0c6bd9aac2512c6d065581882d43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the largest possible value of the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the remainders and what we're dividing by, we can represent the numbers like this:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f969fbcf047cd624d950ab445e4f3c92736f66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$857 = nk_{1} + 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/d/aedb8172aebb1997494c2cb47dc2f8c420bf2e3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$908 = nk_{2} + 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/9/5992cb1d1246c437ae6668ca1dc178380c1b8d92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/c/f9c9d4294cab83a14257a5ae95ca4bf7886e521e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> are both positive integers.\n</p><p>We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/2/2123df5e506f952b6c0a48e1ab1ac97eea95c153.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$nk_{1} = 857 - 17 = 840 = 2^{3} \\times 3 \\times 5 \\times 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"308\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/7/25785ee5680170da5bbc0d9cf53e874e60e4d814.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$nk_{2} = 908 - 26 = 882 = 2 \\times 3^{2} \\times 7^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"284\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We want to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, so we can set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5cab735b5919a59197601fbb926b1d78a8e7d4ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2 \\times 3 \\times 7 = \\boxed{42}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"162\" height=\"25\" /> because that's the GCD of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd39493493659fb36ab2875b266a4874b475f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$840$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/b/b1baed99ab449348b514f3f3c15e2a823a4dd21f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$882$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC\">2024 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>